Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:47:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: opt-in NPS5_KK_RESIDENCY_LOCK (residency-set
 lock across the queue commit) and NPS5_KK_RESIDENCY_AUDIT (attachment
 residency classes) (nps5 devlost)

Metal API validation in SAROS dlB: 'residency sets do not support concurrent
write operations' at queue commit (the set is added to/committed on other
threads under its mutex, the queue commit reads it without) and 30898x
'Attachment texture ... is not added to any residency set'. Both default off.

